# The Allowlisted Repository set — the repositories this server may touch at all.
#
# Copy to repositories.yaml and enumerate your own. The server refuses to start if this
# file is missing or lists nothing: an absent list is indistinguishable from permission
# to reach every repository the credential can.
#
# Wildcards are refused. A pattern is how "every repository I can reach" becomes the
# accidental default, and this list is load-bearing — Bitbucket sells no permission that
# separates commenting from merging, so see docs/adr/0002-comment-only-blast-radius.md.
#
# No secrets belong in this file. It is meant to be committed.

repositories:
  - streamstech/db-explorer
  - streamstech/lent-manager
